{"title": "Potion of Angelic Slumber", "pageid": 10294, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber", "categories": ["Bugs", "Potions", "Very rare items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-veryrare\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Faded.png/300px-POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/b/b3/POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Potion of Angelic Slumber image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Faded.png/300px-POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b3/POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #D1017B ;\">Potion of Angelic Slumber</span></a> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Consumables\" title=\"Consumables\">Consumable</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Potions\" title=\"Potions\">Potion</a>). It has a beneficial utility effect.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>One of the few ways for elves to experience sleep. Other methods include taking narcotics and being hit very hard with a chair.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Potions\" title=\"Potions\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Potions_Icon.png/25px-Potions_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Potions_Icon.png/38px-Potions_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Potions_Icon.png/50px-Potions_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Potions\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Potions_Icon.png/25px-Potions_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d7/Potions_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Potions\" title=\"Potions\">Potions</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png/25px-Consumables_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png/38px-Consumables_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Single Use\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png/25px-Consumables_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Single Use</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Very rare\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #D1017B ;\">Very rare</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.1 kg (0.2 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.1 kg (0.2 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 200 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  200  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-788d6021d6af2243END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-84895e6cf92f9024END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-bebf75236c3ef912END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">ALCH_Solution_Potion_Rest_Greater</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ALCH_Solution_Potion_Rest_Greater\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ALCH_Solution_Potion_Rest_Greater\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">4d801c1a-691e-47c8-88e7-78367b4e2c8e</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:4d801c1a-691e-47c8-88e7-78367b4e2c8e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:4d801c1a-691e-47c8-88e7-78367b4e2c8e\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">ALCH_Solution_Potion_Rest_Greater</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ALCH_Solution_Potion_Rest_Greater+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ALCH_Solution_Potion_Rest_Greater+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Effect\"> Effect </span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"> <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/35px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/46px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Action</a> </span>\n</p>\n<ul><li class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></li>\n<li>Consume the potion to apply <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_(Condition)\" title=\"Potion of Angelic Slumber (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/62/POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/62/POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Potion of Angelic Slumber\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/62/POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_(Condition)\" title=\"Potion of Angelic Slumber (Condition)\">Potion of Angelic Slumber</a> on yourself.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber\"> Condition: Potion of Angelic Slumber </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_(Condition)\" title=\"Potion of Angelic Slumber (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/62/POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/62/POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Potion of Angelic Slumber\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/62/POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_(Condition)\" title=\"Potion of Angelic Slumber (Condition)\">Potion of Angelic Slumber</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 2  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Affected entity falls asleep for 2 rounds. When it wakes up, it receives the effects of a <a href=\"/wiki/Long_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long Rest\">Long Rest</a>. If interrupted before the duration expires, the effects do not apply.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/W%27wargaz\" title=\"W'wargaz\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c3/Portrait_W%27wargaz.png/25px-Portrait_W%27wargaz.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c3/Portrait_W%27wargaz.png/38px-Portrait_W%27wargaz.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c3/Portrait_W%27wargaz.png/50px-Portrait_W%27wargaz.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ch'r'ai W'wargaz\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c3/Portrait_W%27wargaz.png/25px-Portrait_W%27wargaz.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c3/Portrait_W%27wargaz.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/W%27wargaz\" title=\"W'wargaz\">Ch'r'ai W'wargaz</a></li>\n<li>Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stalker_Svignee\" title=\"Stalker Svignee\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Portrait_Stalker_Svignee.png/25px-Portrait_Stalker_Svignee.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/60/Portrait_Stalker_Svignee.png/38px-Portrait_Stalker_Svignee.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/60/Portrait_Stalker_Svignee.png/50px-Portrait_Stalker_Svignee.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stalker Svignee\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Portrait_Stalker_Svignee.png/25px-Portrait_Stalker_Svignee.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/60/Portrait_Stalker_Svignee.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stalker_Svignee\" title=\"Stalker Svignee\">Stalker Svignee</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Upper_City_Sewers\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Upper City Sewers\">Upper City Sewers</a></li>\n<li>Crafted via <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy\" title=\"Alchemy\">Alchemy</a> by combining<span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Essence_of_Planetar_Feather\" title=\"Essence of Planetar Feather\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5e/Essence_of_Planetar_Feather_Item_Icon.png/20px-Essence_of_Planetar_Feather_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5e/Essence_of_Planetar_Feather_Item_Icon.png/30px-Essence_of_Planetar_Feather_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5e/Essence_of_Planetar_Feather_Item_Icon.png/40px-Essence_of_Planetar_Feather_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5e/Essence_of_Planetar_Feather_Item_Icon.png/20px-Essence_of_Planetar_Feather_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5e/Essence_of_Planetar_Feather_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Essence_of_Planetar_Feather\" title=\"Essence of Planetar Feather\">Essence of Planetar Feather</a> (procured from<span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Planetar_Feather\" title=\"Planetar Feather\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Planetar_Feather_Item_Icon.png/20px-Planetar_Feather_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Planetar_Feather_Item_Icon.png/30px-Planetar_Feather_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Planetar_Feather_Item_Icon.png/40px-Planetar_Feather_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Planetar_Feather_Item_Icon.png/20px-Planetar_Feather_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bf/Planetar_Feather_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Planetar_Feather\" title=\"Planetar Feather\">Planetar Feather</a>) and any <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy#Extractions\" title=\"Alchemy\">Suspension</a></li>\n<li>Sold by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Koll_(kobold)\" title=\"Koll (kobold)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Portrait_Koll_%28kobold%29.png/25px-Portrait_Koll_%28kobold%29.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Portrait_Koll_%28kobold%29.png/38px-Portrait_Koll_%28kobold%29.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Portrait_Koll_%28kobold%29.png/50px-Portrait_Koll_%28kobold%29.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Koll the Red\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Portrait_Koll_%28kobold%29.png/25px-Portrait_Koll_%28kobold%29.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Portrait_Koll_%28kobold%29.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Koll_(kobold)\" title=\"Koll (kobold)\">Koll the Red</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/High_Hall\" title=\"High Hall\">High Hall</a></li>\n<li>Inside a Rustic Chest downstairs in <a href=\"/wiki/The_Waning_Moon\" title=\"The Waning Moon\">The Waning Moon</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-205&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-86</span></li>\n<li>Inside a locked Opulent Chest in the boudoir in the <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Hope\" title=\"House of Hope\">House of Hope</a></li>\n<li>Inside a locked Gilded Chest in the hallway between the boudoir and the archive in the <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Hope\" title=\"House of Hope\">House of Hope</a></li>\n<li>Inside each Gilded Chest near the brain stem in <a href=\"/wiki/High_Hall\" title=\"High Hall\">High Hall</a></li></ul>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This potion does not reset the number of short rests that the character can take before their next long rest, although it does restore a bard's <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Song_of_Rest\" title=\"Song of Rest\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b1/Song_of_Rest_Icon.webp/20px-Song_of_Rest_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b1/Song_of_Rest_Icon.webp/30px-Song_of_Rest_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b1/Song_of_Rest_Icon.webp/40px-Song_of_Rest_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Song of Rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b1/Song_of_Rest_Icon.webp/20px-Song_of_Rest_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b1/Song_of_Rest_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Song_of_Rest\" title=\"Song of Rest\">Song of Rest</a>, which can provide a short rest.</li>\n<li>It restores once-per-long-rest item abilities, but only certain <a href=\"/wiki/Illithid_powers\" title=\"Illithid powers\">illithid powers</a>.<sup><i>[<a class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\" href=\"#Bugs\">See: Bugs</a>]</i></sup></li>\n<li>This potion cannot be applied by throwing; it can only be drunk.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>After this potion is consumed, unequipping any equipment or saving and then loading the savegame depletes any of the potion-replenished long and short rest abilities on a character's items again.</li>\n<li>Illithid powers which are <i>not</i> restored by the potion include: <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Illithid_Persuasion\" title=\"Illithid Persuasion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4e/Illithid_Persuasion_Icon.webp/20px-Illithid_Persuasion_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4e/Illithid_Persuasion_Icon.webp/30px-Illithid_Persuasion_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4e/Illithid_Persuasion_Icon.webp/40px-Illithid_Persuasion_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Illithid Persuasion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4e/Illithid_Persuasion_Icon.webp/20px-Illithid_Persuasion_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4e/Illithid_Persuasion_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Illithid_Persuasion\" title=\"Illithid Persuasion\">Illithid Persuasion</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Luck_of_the_Far_Realms\" title=\"Luck of the Far Realms\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c5/Luck_of_the_Far_Realms_Icon.webp/20px-Luck_of_the_Far_Realms_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c5/Luck_of_the_Far_Realms_Icon.webp/30px-Luck_of_the_Far_Realms_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c5/Luck_of_the_Far_Realms_Icon.webp/40px-Luck_of_the_Far_Realms_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Luck of the Far Realms\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c5/Luck_of_the_Far_Realms_Icon.webp/20px-Luck_of_the_Far_Realms_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c5/Luck_of_the_Far_Realms_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Luck_of_the_Far_Realms\" title=\"Luck of the Far Realms\">Luck of the Far Realms</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Psionic_Dominance\" title=\"Psionic Dominance\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Psionic_Dominance_Icon.webp/20px-Psionic_Dominance_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Psionic_Dominance_Icon.webp/30px-Psionic_Dominance_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Psionic_Dominance_Icon.webp/40px-Psionic_Dominance_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Psionic Dominance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Psionic_Dominance_Icon.webp/20px-Psionic_Dominance_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/85/Psionic_Dominance_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Psionic_Dominance\" title=\"Psionic Dominance\">Psionic Dominance</a>, and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Freecast\" title=\"Freecast\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Freecast_Icon.webp/20px-Freecast_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Freecast_Icon.webp/30px-Freecast_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Freecast_Icon.webp/40px-Freecast_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Freecast\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Freecast_Icon.webp/20px-Freecast_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Freecast_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Freecast\" title=\"Freecast\">Freecast</a>.</li>\n<li>The potion does not restore <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Portent\" title=\"Portent\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1d/Portent_Icon.webp/20px-Portent_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1d/Portent_Icon.webp/30px-Portent_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1d/Portent_Icon.webp/40px-Portent_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Portent\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1d/Portent_Icon.webp/20px-Portent_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1d/Portent_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Portent\" title=\"Portent\">Portent</a> Dice.</li>\n<li>The potion does not remove the unique buff <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rapture_(Condition)\" title=\"Rapture (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Rapture\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Rapture_(Condition)\" title=\"Rapture (Condition)\">Rapture</a> or the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dislocated_Shoulder_(Condition)\" title=\"Dislocated Shoulder (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dislocated Shoulder\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dislocated_Shoulder_(Condition)\" title=\"Dislocated Shoulder (Condition)\">Dislocated Shoulder</a> condition.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 185.33333333333px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 183.33333333333px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Model.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"In-game model\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3b/Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Model.png/275px-Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Model.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3b/Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Model.png/413px-P